seed  (GHSA-pqhr-mp3f-hrpp): avatar=http://[::1]:9111/          (bare IPv6 loopback)
residual (CVE-2026-44589):   avatar=http://[::ffff:7f00:1]:9111/ (hex-compressed IPv4-mapped loopback)

